			"notes": "**What's new?**\n- Reworked Game Rules screen for both world creation and in-game editing:\n  new two-line row layout with the rule name, its ID and per-row controls.\n- Type filter: All / Boolean / Integer / Modified.\n- Full-text search across rule names, IDs, categories and descriptions.\n- Pinning: star any rule to keep it in a ★ Pinned section at the top\n  of the list. Pins are saved between sessions.\n- Presets: separate preset screen with the list of saved presets,\n  one-click Load/Delete, and saving the current setup under a custom name.\n- Per-rule Reset (R) button with its own tooltip, plus a global Reset all button.\n- Modified rules are highlighted yellow in the list.\n- Category headers with rule counts; rule tooltips with ID and description.\n- Full English and Russian translations of the menu."
		}
